{"words": [{"text": "وَقَالُوا۟", "translation": "And they say"}, {"text": "لَن", "translation": "Never"}, {"text": "تَمَسَّنَا", "translation": "will touch us"}, {"text": "ٱلنَّارُ", "translation": "the Fire"}, {"text": "إِلَّآ", "translation": "except"}, {"text": "أَيَّامًۭا", "translation": "(for) days"}, {"text": "مَّعْدُودَةًۭ ۚ", "translation": "numbered"}, {"text": "قُلْ", "translation": "Say"}, {"text": "أَتَّخَذْتُمْ", "translation": "Have you taken"}, {"text": "عِندَ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "عَهْدًۭا", "translation": "a covenant"}, {"text": "فَلَن", "translation": "so never"}, {"text": "يُخْلِفَ", "translation": "will break"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "عَهْدَهُۥٓ ۖ", "translation": "His Covenant"}, {"text": "أَمْ", "translation": "Or"}, {"text": "تَقُولُونَ", "translation": "(do) you say"}, {"text": "عَلَى", "translation": "against"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "مَا", "translation": "what"}, {"text": "لَا", "translation": "not"}, {"text": "تَعْلَمُونَ", "translation": "you know"}], "sahih": "And they say, \"Never will the Fire touch us, except for [a few] numbered days.\" Say, \"Have you taken a covenant with Allāh? For Allāh will never break His covenant. Or do you say about Allāh that which you do not know?\""}